data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Wait, I should reconsider. The Page component's own styles (cs-component-page-1) set `min-height: 0` and `width: 100%`. It doesn't fill height or center. The AppShell sets `height: 100vh` and flex-direction: column. So to fill available height and center, the developer needs to make Page or its container flex:1 and center.\n\nActually, maybe the AppShell child layout isn't giving Page the full height. Let me check AppShell.js to understand. But I don't want to get too deep. The design is explicit: card centered vertically and horizontally, page content fills available height.\n\nI think I should send rework. But I also need to be careful - the developer might have taken \"Page\" to handle centering. The Page component's catalog says it centers content horizontally and provides page scroll. But the design explicitly says center vertically.\n\nLet me send a focused rework dispatch."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789959253,"id":"chatcmpl-0a404fae69e04bf888a87ce3666c7a1e","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"content\": \"Rework: the layout does not yet match DESIGN.md.\\n\\nThe page currently renders the greeting Card right under the Header, with a large empty area below it. DESIGN.md requires:\\n\\n1. The page content area between the Header and Footer must fill the available viewport height.\\n2. The Card containing the greeting and buttons must be centred both vertically and horizontally inside that content area.\\n\\nEverything else in the current implementation (Header title, greeting text, colour tokens, four labelled buttons, active-button variant, Footer text, style imports, server binding, README, .gitignore) is correct — keep it.\\n\\nFix only the layout in `src/App.jsx` so the Card is vertically and horizontally centred in the space between Header and Footer. You can achieve this by making the `Page` wrapper (or a direct child of `AppShell` around `Page`) a flex container with `flex: 1 1 auto`, `display: flex`, `alignItems: center`, and `justifyContent: center`. Ensure the wrapper itself grows to fill the remaining viewport height after the Header.\\n\\nAfter fixing:\\n- Run `npm run build` to confirm it still builds.\\n- Confirm `npm run dev` still binds to `0.0.0.0:5173`.\\n- Commit the change and reply.\\n\", \"filePath\": \"/tmp/dispatch-developer-rework.md\"}","name":"write"},"id":"write_54","index":0,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789959253,"id":"chatcmpl-0a404fae69e04bf888a87ce3666c7a1e","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

